Package: miadi-deepdiver-chromium
Version: 1.64.1-1
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Miadi Factory <miadi@sanctuaireagentique.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3 (<< 3.13), ca-certificates, libc6 (>= 2.35), libasound2t64 | libasound2, libatk1.0-0t64 | libatk1.0-0, libatk-bridge2.0-0t64 | libatk-bridge2.0-0, libatspi2.0-0t64 | libatspi2.0-0, libcairo2, libcups2t64 | libcups2, libdbus-1-3, libdrm2, libexpat1, libgbm1, libglib2.0-0t64 | libglib2.0-0, libnspr4, libnss3, libpango-1.0-0, libudev1, libx11-6, libxcb1, libxcomposite1, libxdamage1, libxext6, libxfixes3, libxkbcommon0, libxrandr2, fonts-liberation, fonts-noto-color-emoji, fontconfig
Homepage: https://playwright.dev/python/docs/browsers
Description: Hash-pinned upstream Chromium installer for Miadi DeepDiver
 Fetches Chrome for Testing, headless shell and ffmpeg directly from their
 upstream servers, with Playwright 1.64.1's pinned revisions and SHA256.
 First configuration requires network; archives are cached for reinstall.
 Private to DeepDiver, no snap, root browser or account access.
 amd64 Ubuntu 22.04/24.04 and Debian 12; upstream browser terms apply.
